{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-10",
  "title": "風前の灯火",
  "storyCode": "4-10",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "af078dffe2d5b01adcd5d1eee562f6207757de0aa5c0e15d1ded0ad2e9108485",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温度が……急に、下がってきたような……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！　地面も凍って……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "さ、寒い……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "っ……！　あ、あの吊るされた人たちまで……氷が、飲み込んで……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そ、それに……空が、あんな黒い雲で……いっぱいに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一体、どうすれば……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ジェシカさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "まずは落ち着いてください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……っ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "はい……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それから、陣形の保持を意識するようにお願いします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解しました！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "フロストリーフ、あなた何をやってるの！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――「フロストノヴァ」……彼女が、辺り一帯の熱を奪っているようですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それにしても、こんな広範囲に影響を及ぼすなんて……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……ハッ、「スノーデビルのお姫様」か……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私より、体温の低い奴を見たのは初めてだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――フロストリーフ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "メテオリーテ……悪いな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そちらに戻って……時間稼ぎをしてやりたいところだが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ッ……！　あなた……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ああ……身体が、凍り始めているんだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "この脚はもう……動かせそうにない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そんな……フロストリーフ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――アーミヤ。包囲を突破して逃げろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "このままでは、一分も持たずに広場のすべてが凍りづけにされそうだからな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行くんだ。私の犠牲を無駄にしないでくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そんなこと……できるわけないでしょう！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "彼女の言う通りです！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "フロストリーフさんを見捨てたりなんてしません……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰一人として、置いて行かないと決めていますから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "メテオリーテさん！　敵部隊の動きは、私が封じておきますので――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "その間に、フロストリーフさんを救出してください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ドクター！　部隊の指揮をお願いします！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "任せてくれ！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（頷く）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "わかった！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "思えば、このアーツ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一度しか使ったことがないんだが、四の五の言ってはいられんな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――「凡そ、血の通う者ならば」……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ほう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "氷には氷を、というわけか。……だが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "くっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これで、上手くは舌が回るまい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貴、様……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "スノーデビル小隊、配置につけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我が兄弟たちよ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奴らの血液に至るまで、すべてを凍らせてやれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任せておいてくれ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "「凡そ、血の通う者ならば」……「その心我の知るところなり」。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今のは……アーツの詠唱か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あのウサギ、何を……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――ん……？　黒い……線？　あれは一体……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ッ！　まさか、さっきのアーツか！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "まずい、こっちに来て――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "や、め――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "っあ……あああああっ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ぐっ……か、身体が熱い……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "メテオリーテさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任せて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そっちも、そのまま続けてちょうだい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ひっ……いやだ……寒、い……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "う、あ……痛い、いたいぃっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……っが……やめ……や、めてくれ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――っ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "急げ！　同胞たちをこれ以上傷つけさせるな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あのアーツ……実に強力だな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "う……ぐっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "お前……たちを……これ、以上……進ませる、わけ……には……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "っ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "悪いが、アーツは使わせんぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "そのまま眠りにつくがいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "お前の苦しみも、すぐに終わらせてやる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "っ……！　ダメ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ああ……それでは、お前がアーミヤか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なるほど、良い目をしている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確かに、戦士に相応しい眼差しだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……けれども……すまないな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あなたは……なぜ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……♬"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――♪――♬――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これは、一体……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――♬――♬――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……雪が……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "「眠れ、眠れ」……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "「ハリネズミの人形と小熊たち」……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "この、変わったメロディー……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――まずい、アーツの詠唱だわ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "「静かな黒に沈め」……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストノヴァ",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……「壊れた人形よ」……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空中に……次々と、黒い氷の結晶が……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あの結晶、ゆっくり落ちていきますよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "触れたところから、地面が黒く凍り付いて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "周りにまで広がってる……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "みるみるうちに、周囲の地形が侵食されていますね……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なんとしても、あの歌を止めなければ！"
    },
